---
layout: layouts/base.njk
section: resorts
title: Resort hotels at Walt Disney World, Disneyland and Universal Orlando
description: Guides to every on-site hotel at Walt Disney World, Disneyland Resort and Universal Orlando Resort, grouped by category, for first-time visitors.
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap page-hero-row">
    <div class="page-hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Resorts</p>
      <h1>Every resort hotel, explained</h1>
      <p class="lead">Plain-English guides to the on-site hotels at Walt Disney World, Disneyland Resort and Universal Orlando Resort. Pick a destination, then a hotel.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <nav class="dest-strip" aria-label="Choose a destination">
    <a class="card dest-card" href="/resorts/" aria-current="page"><span class="eyebrow">Orlando, Florida</span><strong>Walt Disney World</strong><small>{{ resorts.length }} Disney resort hotels</small></a>
    <a class="card dest-card" href="/disneyland/"><span class="eyebrow">{{ disneyland.where }}</span><strong>Disneyland Resort</strong><small>{{ disneyland.hotels.length }} Disney hotels and villas</small></a>
    <a class="card dest-card" href="/universal-orlando/"><span class="eyebrow">{{ universal.where }}</span><strong>Universal Orlando Resort</strong><small>{{ universal.hotels.length }} on-site hotels</small></a>
  </nav>

  <h2 class="dest-title" id="walt-disney-world">Walt Disney World</h2>
  <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by area">
    <button type="button" class="chip" aria-pressed="true" data-area="">All areas</button>
    {% for a in ["Magic Kingdom area", "Epcot area", "Animal Kingdom area", "Disney Springs area", "Wide World of Sports area"] %}
    <button type="button" class="chip" aria-pressed="false" data-area="{{ a }}">{{ a | replace(" area", "") }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  {% for t in tiers %}
  <section class="section tier" id="{{ t.slug }}">
    <h2>{{ t.plural or t.name }}</h2>
    <p class="tier-blurb">{{ t.blurb }}</p>
    <div class="grid-3">
      {% for r in resorts | byTier(t.name) %}
      <a class="card resort-card" href="/resorts/{{ r.slug }}/" data-area="{{ r.area }}">
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ r.area }}</span>
        <strong>{{ r.short }}</strong>
        <small>{{ r.theme }}</small>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <p class="fineprint">Hotels on Disney property that Disney does not run, such as the Swan, Dolphin and Swan Reserve, Shades of Green, and the Disney Springs area hotels, will get their own guides later.</p>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
  var chips = document.querySelectorAll('.chip');
  chips.forEach(function (chip) {
    chip.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var area = chip.getAttribute('data-area');
      chips.forEach(function (c) { c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', c === chip); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.resort-card').forEach(function (card) {
        card.hidden = area && card.getAttribute('data-area') !== area;
      });
      document.querySelectorAll('.tier').forEach(function (sec) {
        sec.hidden = !sec.querySelector('.resort-card:not([hidden])');
      });
    });
  });
})();
</script>
